{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T16:55:13+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T16:55:13+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Forvia SE","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Parts","country":"France","city":"Nanterre","website":"https://www.forvia.com","employees":103434,"summary":"Forvia SE, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells automotive technology solutions in France, Germany, other European countries, other Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Americas, Asia, and internationally. It operates through Seating, Interiors, Clean Mobility, Electronics, Lighting, and Lifecycle Solutions segments. The Seating segment designs and manufactures vehicle seats, seating frames, and adjustment mechanisms. The Interiors segment designs, manufactures, and assembles instrument panels, door panels, and modules. The Clean Mobility segment designs and manufactures exhaust systems, solutions for fuel cell electric vehicles, and aftertreatment solutions for commercial vehicles. The Electronics segment designs and manufactures display technologies, driver assistance systems, and cockpit electronics, including HELLA electronics and Clarion electronics. The Lighting segment designs and manufactures lighting technologies. The Lifecycle Solutions segment provides solutions extending the vehicle lifecycle, as well as workshop equipment and special original equipment. The company was formerly known as Faurecia S.E. and changed its name to Forvia SE in June 2023. Forvia SE was founded in 1914 and is headquartered in Nanterre, France.","exchange":"Paris","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Forvia SE, avec ses filiales, fabrique et vend des solutions technologiques automobiles en France, en Allemagne, dans d’autres pays européens, en Europe, au Moyen-Orient, en Afrique, en Amérique, en Asie et à l’international. Il opère à travers les segments Sièges, Intérieurs, Mobilité propre, Électronique, Éclairage et Solutions de cycle de vie. Le segment Seating conçoit et fabrique des sièges de véhicule, des cadres de sièges et des mécanismes de réglage."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":1529146880,"shares_outstanding":184057161,"trailing_pe":null,"forward_pe":3.6043382,"price_to_book":0.8014663,"ev_to_ebitda":4.424,"ev_to_revenue":0.437,"dividend_yield":0.0,"payout_ratio":0.4464,"beta_yahoo":1.662},"targets":{"current_price":8.308,"mean":14.56538,"median":13.0,"high":39.0,"low":10.5,"n_analysts":13,"reco_mean":1.92308,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-07-31"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":4953000000,"ex_dividend":"2024-06-04","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.19021,"institutions_pct":0.36133,"institutions_float_pct":0.44621,"institutions_n":149,"institutions":[{"name":"Paradigm Asset Management Company, LLC","pct":0.0,"shares":1074,"value":8922,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"Kelleher Financial Advisors","pct":0.0,"shares":74,"value":614,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.3704}],"funds":[{"name":"TR PRICE-Price (T.Rowe) International Value Equity Trust","pct":0.0148,"shares":2924519,"value":24296902,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.1384},{"name":"T. ROWE PRICE Intl Fd.S, INC.-T. Rowe Price Intl Value Eqy. Fd.","pct":0.0123000005,"shares":2414653,"value":20060936,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.0336},{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0117999995,"shares":2329918,"value":19356957,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.008,"shares":1566931,"value":13018062,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0046},{"name":"Dimensional ETF Trust-Dimensional International Small Cap Value ETF","pct":0.0067000003,"shares":1326903,"value":11023909,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.3496},{"name":"SCHWAB STRATEGIC TRUST-Schwab Fundamental International Equity ETF","pct":0.00